    "grounding": [
      "The creative direction names harvest and abundance.",
      "The palette intent calls for natural warmth and enough restraint to remain composed rather than busy.",
      "The tonal intent settles into the softer warmth of late afternoon in a garden.",
      "Abundance may be expressed through composition and generosity, not only through imagery."
    ],
    "experience": "Arriving should feel generous, warm and celebratory, with a satisfying sense of plenty presented with confidence and taste.",
    "foregrounds": "Harvest and abundance as the celebratory expression of the locally grown idea.",
    "distinctFrom": "This provides greater richness and ceremonial presence than the gently unfolding cultivation approach, while feeling more settled and encompassing than the brisk market-led alternative.",
